1. The synthesis of evidence and learning from evaluations of WFP’s performance measurement and monitoring between 2018 and 2021 was included in the WFP Office of Evaluation workplan for 2021–2023 and was conducted by an external team working between November 2021 and October 2022, with planned submission to the Executive Board for consideration at its first regular session in February 2023.
4. The intended users of the synthesis include primarily WFP’s Corporate Planning and Performance Division (CPP) and Research, Assessment and Monitoring Division (RAM), but also programme and policy owners, regional bureaux and country offices.
5. The synthesis asked seven questions that examine the extent to which:
